# Git for Windows ships with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every checked-out text file to CRLF.
# Prettier is configured with endOfLine=lf, so without this the windows-latest CI legs fail `pnpm
# lint` on every file, and blob hashes differ between platforms — breaking the reproducible-commit
# assertion in test/determinism.test.ts. specs/02 §2.7 makes Windows a first-class target.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
